{
  "name": "matching",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "intent": "スタッフのスキル欄と案件の必須スキル欄を結び、候補一覧の器を作る",
  "tags": [
    "matching",
    "staffing",
    "assignment",
    "マッチング",
    "スキル",
    "案件",
    "アサイン"
  ],
  "slots": {
    "staff": {
      "type": "entity",
      "required": true,
      "desc": "スタッフのエンティティ"
    },
    "opening": {
      "type": "entity",
      "required": true,
      "desc": "案件のエンティティ"
    },
    "skills": {
      "type": "field",
      "of": "staff",
      "required": true,
      "desc": "スタッフ側のスキルフィールド名"
    },
    "required_skills": {
      "type": "field",
      "of": "opening",
      "required": false,
      "default": "required_skills",
      "desc": "案件側の必須スキルフィールド名。省略時は required_skills"
    }
  },
  "effects": ["read(staff)", "read(openings)", "write(matches)"],
  "artifacts": [
    {"path": "db/schema.sql#matches", "kind": "SQL", "lines": 14, "desc": "スタッフと案件の候補"},
    {"path": "api/matches/route.ts", "kind": "API", "lines": 60, "desc": "スキル欄を使った候補一覧"},
    {"path": "app/(admin)/matches/page.tsx", "kind": "UI", "lines": 75, "desc": "マッチング画面"},
    {"path": "lib/matching/suggest.ts", "kind": "TS", "lines": 40, "desc": "候補抽出。スキルの一致判定は実行時"},
    {"path": "tests/matches.test.ts", "kind": "TEST", "lines": 40, "desc": "スキル欄が揃っているかのテスト"}
  ],
  "examples": ["examples/staffing.prout", "examples/staffing_desk.prout"],
  "notes": [
    "検査するのはフィールドの存在だけ。スキル集合の包含は、契約層がコレクション契約を実行時ガードにしているため、ここでは証明しない。",
    "スキル欄の型は String を想定する。複数値の型は無い。"
  ],
  "provenance": {
    "author": "PROUT staffing prototype",
    "date": "2026-11-21",
    "extracted_from": ["staffing", "staffing_desk"],
    "note": "スタッフと案件をスキル欄で結ぶ器。中身の一致は実行時に残す。"
  }
}
